<title>UK: SCA Group prices 200 mln mark exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>SCA Group prices 200 mln mark exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCA GROUP HOLDING BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  Svenska Cellulosa AB</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.50	MATURITY    01.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  93.16     PAY DATE</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 REOFFER    =	   YTM	   4.0 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGEABLE INTO INDUSTRIVARDEN A SHARES AT</p>
<p>		INDICATED EXCHANGE PREMIUM OF 12-16 PCT.</p>
<p>		TWO YEARS HARD NON CALL THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT</p>
<p>		ACCRETED VALUE SUBJECT TO 130 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		LONG FIRST COUPON TO 01.JUL.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
